{"id":"7ef2ab1cd7823ee9","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-order-rudin-keisler-order.md","title":"ZFC Order Rudin Keisler Order","display":"df-zfc-order-rudin-keisler-order — ZFC Order Rudin Keisler Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order-rudin-keisler-order","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order-rudin-keisler-order"],"display":"df-zfc-order-rudin-keisler-order — ZFC Order Rudin Keisler Order","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order-rudin-keisler-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order-rudin-keisler-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order-rudin-keisler-order — ZFC Order Rudin Keisler Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V,Y,U,X\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal V,Y,U,X\\in V\\)</span>; the first displayed ultrafilter is the Rudin--Keisler reduct of the second</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (typed set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrderRudinKeislerOrder}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrderRudinKeislerOrder}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order\\text{-}rudin\\text{-}keisler\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrderRudinKeislerOrder}_S(\\mathcal V,Y,U,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal V,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)\n\\land\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq Y\\;\n\\bigl(A\\in\\mathcal V\\leftrightarrow\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\in A\\}\\in U\\bigr)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order\\text{-}rudin\\text{-}keisler\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrderRudinKeislerOrder}_S(\\mathcal V,Y,U,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal V,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)\n\\land\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq Y\\;\n\\bigl(A\\in\\mathcal V\\leftrightarrow\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\in A\\}\\in U\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The reduct ultrafilter is written <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>, avoiding collision with the metatheoretic universe <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>; the witnessing map and every inverse image are explicitly set-coded.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (typed set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal V,Y,U,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrderRudinKeislerOrder}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order\\text{-}rudin\\text{-}keisler\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrderRudinKeislerOrder}_S(\\mathcal V,Y,U,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal V,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)\n\\land\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq Y\\;\n\\bigl(A\\in\\mathcal V\\leftrightarrow\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\in A\\}\\in U\\bigr)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1385,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2850","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-order-rudin-keisler-order.md|58-df-zfc-order-rudin-keisler-order]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","36d7463d215be751"]}